    "group": "Lelith Hesperax",
    "summary": "When you pick a unit to fight during the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), you may pay 1 Pain token if it is this model’s unit. Doing so makes that unit [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). Its models gain 1 Strength and improve Armour Penetration by 1 on each melee attack while [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain).",
